    "id":"trade-04","section":"trade","chapter":"inquiry","label":"外贸入门 · 04","title":"What Is the Price?","zhTitle":"询问价格与数量","subtitle":"用简短句子询价、报数量，并确认下一步。","description":"价格数量 · 通用外贸","audio":"audio/trade-04.mp3","timings":"timings/trade-04.json","speakers":["Evan","Dean"],"roles":{"Evan":"供应商代表","Dean":"客户"},
    "context":{"en":"Dean asks about a lamp. Evan explains the price and asks about quantity.","zh":"情景演练：客户想采购一款灯具，双方询问单价和数量。价格、数量只是语言练习示例，不代表真实报价。"},
    "dialogue":[
      ["Dean","What is the price?","价格是多少？"],
      ["Evan","It's five dollars each.","每个五美元。"],
      ["Dean","Is that the price for one?","那是一个的价格吗？"],
      ["Evan","Yes. How many do you need?","是的。你需要多少个？"],
      ["Dean","Can I order fifty pieces?","我能订五十个吗？"],
      ["Evan","Yes. Fifty pieces is fine.","可以。五十个没问题。"],
      ["Dean","Does the price include shipping?","价格包含运费吗？"],
      ["Evan","No. Shipping is extra.","不包含。运费另算。"],
      ["Dean","Can you check the total?","你能确认一下总额吗？"],
      ["Evan","Yes. I'll email the total.","可以，我会把总额通过邮件发给你。"],
      ["Dean","Thank you. I'll check it today.","谢谢，我今天会查看。"],
      ["Evan","Please let me know if you have questions.","如果有问题，请告诉我。"]
    ],
